{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NODE is a puzzle platformer in 2.5.D that redefines the genre with its Timeline-based navigation. In this engaging and atmospheric adventure you guide your robot on a journey through enigmatic remains of a top-secret Soviet nuclear complex. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLAN, STRATEGIZE, EXECUTE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Plan your robot\u2019s route by examining the Nuclear Plant blueprints and considering the information and clues you have found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757670/extras/mapSequence.gif?t=1744906093\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Create a sequence of commands on a Timeline for your robot to navigate between checkpoints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757670/extras/constructTimeline.gif?t=1744906093\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Execute the Timelined commands, witness the results, and adjust to solve the puzzle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757670/extras/planExecuted.gif?t=1744906093\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENGAGING AND ATMOSPHERIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a world where Cold War era historical intrigue meets science fiction, delivered by rich imagery and intricate level design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757670/extras/atmosphere.gif?t=1744906093\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BRANCHING DIALOG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live the story through dynamic dialogues with branching paths. Shape the narrative as you progress. Make decisions that impact the course of your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757670/extras/branchingDialog.png?t=1744906093\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIND SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore beyond the main path and find hidden challenges. Uncover secrets and easter eggs. Dive in deeper narrative layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757670/extras/secrets.gif?t=1744906093\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2757670?t=1744906093","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744906093","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744906093","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757670/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744906093","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NODE is a puzzle platformer in 2.5.D that redefines the genre with its Timeline-based navigation. In this engaging and atmospheric adventure you guide your robot on a journey through enigmatic remains of a top-secret Soviet nuclear complex. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLAN, STRATEGIZE, EXECUTE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Plan your robot\u2019s route by examining the Nuclear Plant blueprints and considering the information and clues you have found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor